{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain","kind":"proposition","title":"Multiplicative-chain index identity: $[\\alpha_{\\mathrm{shift}}(T_{2,9})]_q [\\alpha_{\\mathrm{shift}}(T_{3,5})]_q = [9]_q [10]_q$","tags":["alpha-em","multiplicative-chain","fine-structure-constant","shift-exponent","torus-knot","force-carrier","delta-q","categorical-composition"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.alpha_em_shift_chain","text":"alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.md","leanSource":"alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain\"></a><!-- Index substitution; the alpha_EM identification itself is prop:em-coupling-projection. -->\n<p><em>The torus-knot shift exponents of <a href=\"#prop:alpha-shift-torus-knot\" data-at=\"mass-theory/spectral-sequence-chirality-confinement\">the shift proposition</a> take the values</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\alpha_{\\mathrm{shift}}(T_{2,9}) = 9, \\qquad \\alpha_{\\mathrm{shift}}(T_{3,5}) = 10 .</code></pre>\n<p><em>Hence the chain form agrees with the bare form of <a href=\"#prop:em-coupling-projection\" data-at=\"predicted-spectra/em-completeness-gauge-coupling\">the EM coupling projection</a>:</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  q \\cdot\n  \\bigl[\\alpha_{\\mathrm{shift}}(T_{2,9})\\bigr]_q \\cdot\n  \\bigl[\\alpha_{\\mathrm{shift}}(T_{3,5})\\bigr]_q\n  \\;=\\;\n  q \\cdot [9]_q \\cdot [10]_q .</code></pre>\n<p><em>That this product is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha_{EM}^{-1}</code> is the claim of the EM coupling projection, not of this proposition.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"16.10.3","page":"b/prop-alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain","qa":{"counts":{"pass":89,"fail":0,"warn":5,"na":18,"unknown":0,"stale":89},"milnor":{"total":1,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.MassTheory.Archimedean.AlphaEmShiftChain.alpha_em_shift_chain","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-shift-multiplicative-chain.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
